{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 32, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the break of dawn, thou shalt arise and make thy way to the airport, where thy journey to Japan doth begin. Take thy time to peruse the wares of the duty-free shops and indulge in a light repast before boarding thy flight.\n\nAs the sun doth set, thou shalt arrive in the bustling city of Tokyo. Make thy way to thy lodgings and rest, for the morrow bringeth a day full of adventure.\n\nAwake early and venture forth to the Meiji Shrine, where thou shalt pay homage to the divine spirits of Emperor Meiji and Empress Shoken. Take in the beauty of the shrine and its surrounding forest, and marvel at the towering torii gates that mark the entrance.\n\nNext, thou shalt make thy way to the Asakusa district, where thou shalt find the Senso-ji Temple. Wander the Nakamise Shopping Street on the way to the temple, and sample the delights of traditional Japanese snacks and souvenirs.\n\nOnce thou hast reached the temple, cleanse thy spirit and offer up a prayer. Take a moment to reflect on the serenity of the temple grounds, and observe the many devotees who have come to pay their respects.\n\nAs the day progresseth, venture to the Ueno district and explore the many museums and galleries that it hath to offer. Peruse the works of art at the Tokyo National Museum, and marvel at the natural history exhibits at the National Museum of Nature and Science.\n\nIn the evening, visit the Shibuya Crossing, where thou shalt bear witness to the frenetic energy of the city as thousands of people cross the intersection at once. Take refuge in a nearby izakaya and indulge in a meal of sushi and sake.\n\nOn the morrow, travel to the city of Kyoto, the former imperial capital of Japan. Wander the streets of the Gion district and imagine the geishas and samurais who once walked these very same paths.\n\nVisit the Kinkaku-ji Temple, also known as the Golden Pavilion, and take in the shimmering beauty of the temple's gold-leaf facade. Take a moment to reflect on the tranquility of the temple's reflecting pond, and observe the many tourists who have come to marvel at its splendor.\n\nIn the evening, attend a traditional tea ceremony and learn about the ancient customs and etiquette of this revered ritual. Sip the frothy matcha and indulge in a sweet treat, and let the serenity of the ceremony wash over thee.\n\nOn the final day of thy journey, visit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park and pay homage to the victims of the atomic bombing. Wander the grounds and observe the many monuments and memorials that stand as a testament to the resilience of the human spirit.\n\nIn the afternoon, return to Tokyo and prepare for thy journey home. Reflect on the wonders of Japan and the memories that thou hast made, and know that thou shalt carry these experiences with thee for a lifetime. Safe travels, and may the winds of fortune guide thee home.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "break", "logprob": -1.4145479202270508}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -1.311301275563892e-06}, {"token": "dawn", "logprob": -0.04357367381453514}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0002896366349887103}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.02207924984395504}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.0010748092317953706}, {"token": "alt", "logprob": -1.6689286894688848e-06}, {"token": "arise", "logprob": -0.03864968568086624}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -1.1324817933200393e-05}, {"token": "make", "logprob": -0.08887630701065063}, {"token": "thy", "logprob": -0.09123393893241882}, {"token": "way", "logprob": -1.9550132492440753e-05}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -9.715084888739511e-05}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -8.868777513271198e-05}, {"token": "airport", "logprob": -0.10450059920549393}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.06244213134050369}, {"token": "where", "logprob": -0.010499831289052963}, {"token"